# tools/kit-boundary.allow — where the app may touch the GPU or a numerics framework (decision D15).
#
# One line per file: <path><TAB><modules the file may import, comma-separated; `-` for a .metal file><TAB><reason>.
# tools/check-kit-boundary.sh fails on a gated import (Accelerate, vecLib, Metal, MetalKit, MetalPerformanceShaders*,
# BNNS, simd) in a file or for a module not listed here, on any vDSP / cblas / vImage / LAPACK / vForce / BNNS / MPS
# symbol in a Swift file outside the learned detector (FourDSTEMStudio/Training/, ADR 071), and on a .metal file not listed.
# Rows whose reason starts with LEFTOVER are numerics or compute the kits should own; they are listed so the guard
# passes today and the debt is visible. Delete the row when the code moves. A new row needs a display or app-provenance
# reason (lineage/marks records need none: they import nothing gated).
FourDSTEMStudio/App/AppState+PhaseMapping.swift	simd	view / overlay geometry in simd, no science
FourDSTEMStudio/App/PendingLoad.swift	Metal	LEFTOVER?: GPU residency / Metal virtual detector dispatch for the 4D cube; candidate for CuboKit (Metal virtual diffraction ask), listed for review
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Analysis/OrientationResult.swift	simd	crystal / orientation vectors in SIMD3 and SIMD4 (types shared with DiffractoKit); no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Analysis/VirtualDetector.swift	Metal	LEFTOVER?: GPU residency / Metal virtual detector dispatch for the 4D cube; candidate for CuboKit (Metal virtual diffraction ask), listed for review
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Crystal/Crystal.swift	simd	crystal / orientation vectors in SIMD3 and SIMD4 (types shared with DiffractoKit); no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Crystal/OrientationPlan.swift	simd	crystal / orientation vectors in SIMD3 and SIMD4 (types shared with DiffractoKit); no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Crystal/PhaseMappingScan.swift	simd	crystal / orientation vectors in SIMD3 and SIMD4 (types shared with DiffractoKit); no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Data/FourDArray.swift	Metal	LEFTOVER?: GPU residency / Metal virtual detector dispatch for the 4D cube; candidate for CuboKit (Metal virtual diffraction ask), listed for review
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/Data/ResidentCube.swift	Metal	LEFTOVER?: GPU residency / Metal virtual detector dispatch for the 4D cube; candidate for CuboKit (Metal virtual diffraction ask), listed for review
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/ML/LearnedDiskDetection.swift	Metal	learned detector (training + refine), stays in the app by decision (D13, ADR 071)
FourDSTEMStudio/Core/ML/LearnedDiskDetector.swift	Metal	learned detector (training + refine), stays in the app by decision (D13, ADR 071)
FourDSTEMStudio/Session/PhaseMappingProduct.swift	simd	crystal / orientation vectors in SIMD3 and SIMD4 (types shared with DiffractoKit); no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Session/PhaseOrientationField.swift	simd	crystal / orientation matrices in simd_double3x3 (types shared with DiffractoKit); the kit colours them, no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Session/GrainsPhaseRun.swift	simd	orientation matrices in simd_double3x3 (the kit's MatrixOrientationField and PhaseOrientationField types); the best phase is the kit's BestPhaseMatching, no own numerics
FourDSTEMStudio/Session/SystemMonitor.swift	Metal	reads the GPU name and memory for the status line
FourDSTEMStudio/Training/DetectorGraph.swift	MetalPerformanceShadersGraph,+symbols	learned detector (training + refine), stays in the app by decision (D13, ADR 071)
FourDSTEMStudio/Training/DetectorTrainer.swift	Metal,MetalPerformanceShadersGraph,+symbols	learned detector (training + refine), stays in the app by decision (D13, ADR 071)
FourDSTEMStudio/UI/PaneOverlays.swift	simd	view / overlay geometry in simd, no science
FourDSTEMStudio/UI/PhaseMappingSettings.swift	simd	view / overlay geometry in simd, no science
FourDSTEMStudioTests/ACOMEulerFrameTests.swift	simd	test of the frame change on the kit orientation matrices (EulerAngles.py4DSTEMOrientationMatrix is simd_double3x3); no own numerics
